report=dict(accepted=True,open_findings=[],scope='Independent coupled implementation and acceptance review for128 final primary fixtures plus20 refinements, both project dispatchers and actual pinned non-UNIT_TEST production reference. Acceptance is limited to declared synthetic software fixtures, not full ECU parity or physical qualification.',created_utc=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),project_head=subprocess.check_output(['git','rev-parse','HEAD'],cwd=ROOT,text=True).strip(),reference_head='9ff5aae44de51fdc00d3fb1c7c2bfc1f0d0b3e20',reference_checkout_clean=True,frozen_source_hashes=current,executed_source_hashes=original['sources'],executable_hashes=original['executables'],tooling_source_delta=dict(path=changed[0],before_sha256=original['sources'][changed[0]],after_sha256=current[changed[0]],basis='Only publication verifier changed after every model run and legacy check completed. Original bytes are retained; every controller, coupling, acquisition, reference adapter, audit and executable remains byte-identical.'),final_dataset_counts=dict(primary=128,refinement=20,legacy_exact_replays=4,deliberate_mutations_rejected=20,neutral_or_nonneutral_causal_controls=28),independent_evidence=dict(direct_acquisition_checks=19,instrumented_coupled_runs=8,instrumented_coupled_checks=15,production_interpolation_observations=330,production_interpolation_value_checks=660,production_trim_tps_checks=12,final_fault_histories=12,final_complete_edge_replays=148,max_final_fuel_edge_integral_error_mg=max(doc(BASE/'edges-trims002-final.json')['max_abs_fuel_residual_mg'],doc(BASE/'edges-trims003-fine-final.json')['max_abs_fuel_residual_mg']),maximum_declared_refinement_relative_difference=maxrefinement,proof_files={p:sha(BASE/p)for p in proofs},mutation_proof=dict(path='audit-mutations002-final.json',sha256=sha(BASE/'audit-mutations002-final.json'))),resolved_findings=[dict(id='acceptance-nonvacuity',resolution='Independent selection/composition/physical-source checks, exact neutral and perturbed actuator-to-shaft controls, complete mode witnesses, special deliberate quantization characterization and exact TPS plateau were added; no failed exploratory matrix is counted as final acceptance.'),dict(id='coherent-wrong-coordinate',resolution='Actual physical sensor/source consistency is checked independently; the exact coherent-coordinate mutation that previously passed is now rejected.'),dict(id='fault-ack-liveness',resolution='ACKs and exact consumption counts are now required. Twelve saved final fault histories independently confirm completed invalid observation, exact pending ID, no hidden good-read recovery, new post-ACK source timestamps and source-time debounce. Erasing ACKs is rejected.'),dict(id='same-time-reference-observation',resolution='Loop-latched raw inputs and rotation state distinguish an earlier completed production loop from same-time raw GPIO updates.'),dict(id='reference-interpolation-error-bound',resolution='Ideal bilinear tolerance was replaced by source-derived exact raw QU1.8 semantics, validated against660 actual production-loop values on independently constructed nonconstant maps.'),dict(id='publication-review-binding',resolution='The publication verifier now binds every integration frozen-source hash and check execution source, retaining and declaring its sole postexecution source delta.')],assessment=['Every controller owns its plant, sensors, shaft history, decoder and scheduler. The independent contact program does not consume qualified project selection state.', 'Every instrumented sampling/actuator point matched the plant physical clock. Integration lands at independent contact edges and each synthetic transaction stage; guarded data are not published early. Write-only acquisition operations do not refresh source time.', 'Analytical integration of every final executed injector edge accounts for plant fuel, and scheduled falling coil edges account for plant spark counts. No commanded-demand fuel shortcut was found.', 'Both disabled project paths preserve the full actuator sequence and plant ledgers under edited unused metadata. Final neutral controls and no-secondary-adapter legacy replays are exact within each ECU.', 'The actual reference setup resolves and configures raw GPIO14/15; reference profile/table writers check exact readbacks and retain production math, sensor, decoder and scheduler code.', 'Final capacity timing faults were independently checked from actual trace reasons: cam_phase_lost occurs after Capacity in both project paths. The target worker can trip without populating summary.protection_stops, so this review used latched trace timing reasons rather than accepting an empty list.', 'Trim events show the declared source-order difference: project requests[18,12,15,15]degrees and reference[17,13,15,15]degrees. Actual physical angle ranges and pulse widths are reported without fitting a new acceptance tolerance. Source-derived full-PW reference fuel trim arithmetic was independently verified with cam-synchronized production execution.', 'All final matrix and refinement native lookup coordinates were independently bounded to rounded raw<=255. The broader reference uint8 bin-search wrap is explicitly outside this domain.'],limitations=['Uncalibrated MVEM air path plus empirical fuel transport/combustion/free-shaft model; no physical engine, electrical, I2C protection, storage, USB, RF, RTOS, CPU or IRQ timing qualification.', 'The project uses the actual portable Acquisition state machine with Synthetic provenance and explicitly assumed register/transaction timings. TargetProtected acquisition and physical MCP/SDK behavior are not validated by this fixture.', 'Reference polling has no equivalent project debounce/freshness/bus-fault/ACK policy. Independent plant trajectories, quantization, loop cadence, scheduler phase and capacity/zero-fuel policies differ; full cross-ECU parity is not claimed.', 'Reference last-demand spark diagnostics are not event-latched during changing demand. Stable trim event ranges are reported directly; they are not fitted timing acceptance thresholds.', 'Exact raw interpolation is accepted only for observed rounded raw lookup coordinates0..255. Higher ratio lookups can wrap the production uint8 bin-search coordinate and remain uncharacterized here.', 'Trim-order cases use constant trims and MAP secondary sources. Mixed secondary source coordinates are exercised separately; enabled nonconstant trim maps under changing secondary sources are not claimed.', 'No real ethanol/flex input producer, continuous blending or full trigger/cylinder/control feature parity. Online TunerStudio acceptance remains open.', 'Exploratory matrix001/002 and initial reviewer probe failures remain preserved. Corrected reviewer assumptions about raw input_valid on age expiry, cranking spark bypass and missing cam input are explicitly diagnostic corrections, not production defects or extra passing coupled cases.', 'Archive packaging/replay follows this review and is owned by the root publication workflow; this review binds final source/data receipts before archive construction.'],reviewed_document_hashes={p:sha(ROOT/p)for p in('docs/engine-secondary-plant.md','docs/engine-secondary-tables.md','docs/engine-development.md','docs/engine-feature-coverage.md')})
